Minecraft Accelerated for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of Minecraft Accelerated 1.0.0 by Mari.
Original source: https://github.com/Cookieglue/PumpkinsAccelerated
Original licence: CC0-1.0

Ported to Horizon by lavoide, and to Sunrise by arismoko: the shears' carving is re-implemented in
Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included). The recipes, loot tables, advancements and
block tag in data/, and the models, textures, translations and icon in assets/ are the original
release's. This port is distributed under the original's licence (CC0-1.0); the licence text is in
LICENSE.
